<title>USA: Geoscience Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Geoscience Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED SUMMARY OF RESULTS</p>
<p>		  (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
